<h1>Promotion stock planning</h1><p>Use actual warehouse issues and your explicit promotion dates and extra demand assumption. StockChief checks stock, promises, dated incoming orders and recorded supplier packs. It changes no selling prices.</p>
<% if(locked){ %><section class="card"><h2><span class="badge">Pro</span> Promotion plans and purchase drafts</h2><p>Pro reviews every plan and purchase draft. Custom can authorize planning and one unapproved purchase draft within a chosen goods-value limit, without training.</p><a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Upgrade</a></section><% }else{ %>
<section class="card"><h2>Choose the exact promotion</h2><form method="post" action="/autopilot/promotion-stock/preview" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<label class="rm-field"><span>Known supplier name</span><input name="supplierName" maxlength="240" required></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Owned warehouse or stock location name</span><input name="locationName" maxlength="240" required></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Promotion reference</span><input name="reference" maxlength="200" required></label>
<label class="rm-field"><span>StockChief SKU codes, one per line</span><textarea name="skuCodes" maxlength="50000" rows="5" required></textarea></label>
<% for(const [key,label] of [['orderByDate','Last order date'],['arrivalDate','Planned arrival date'],['startsOn','Promotion start'],['endsOn','Promotion end']]){ %><label class="rm-field"><span><%= label %></span><input name="<%= key %>" type="date" required></label><% } %>
<label class="rm-field"><span>Extra demand during the promotion (%)</span><input name="upliftPercent" type="number" min="0" max="1000" step="1" required></label><p>This percentage is your assumption, not a guaranteed forecast. Up to 250 whole-unit products and 50 owned stock locations per warehouse scope. Lots, serials, measured stock and new products without issue history need separate review.</p><button class="btn">Review promotion stock plan</button></form></section>
<% if(draft){ %><section class="card"><h2>Review the exact stock basis</h2><%- include('promotion-stock-body',{facts:draft}) %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/promotion-stock" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><% for(const key of ['supplierId','locationId','reference','orderByDate','arrivalDate','startsOn','endsOn','upliftPercent']){ %><input type="hidden" name="<%= key %>" value="<%= draft.scope[key] %>"><% } %><input type="hidden" name="skuIds" value="<%= draft.scope.skuIds.join(',') %>"><input type="hidden" name="sourceFingerprint" value="<%= draft.sourceFingerprint %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I reviewed these exact dates, products, extra demand assumption and stock basis. Saving this plan creates no purchase.</label><button class="btn" <%= shadow?'disabled':'' %>>Save reviewed promotion plan</button></form></section><% } %><% } %>
<% if(rows.length){ %><section class="card"><h2>Saved promotions</h2><% for(const p of rows){ %><article><h3><% if(!locked){ %><a href="/autopilot/promotion-stock/<%= p.id %>"><%= p.reference %> · <%= p.supplier_name %> · <%= p.location_name %></a><% }else{ %><%= p.reference %> · <%= p.supplier_name %> · <%= p.location_name %><% } %></h3><p><%= p.enabled?(plan==='enterprise'?'Scoped planning enabled':'Automatic planning paused on this plan'):'Automatic planning stopped' %>. <%= p.last_issue||'' %></p><% if(p.enabled){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/promotion-stock/<%= p.id %>/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><button class="btn" name="stop" value="yes">Stop promotion planning</button></form><% } %></article><% } %></section><% } %>
<nav aria-label="Saved promotion pages"><% if(page>1){ %><a href="/autopilot/promotion-stock?page=<%= page-1 %>">Newer promotions</a><% } %> <% if(more){ %><a href="/autopilot/promotion-stock?page=<%= page+1 %>">Older promotions</a><% } %></nav><p>AI credits used: 0.</p>
